      S("Contact the center or the national office", "The guide says to contact the center, or the national MBDA office, to confirm that it is open. The guide does not give a phone number or an address, so look for the contact details of the center you have in mind. Write down who you spoke to, the date and what they told you.", ["A pen and paper", "The name of the center you are thinking of"], "gaoMbda", "you have asked a center or the national office whether it is open and noted the answer.", []),
      S("Find the dependable free help", "While you wait, use the help the guide calls dependable: Small Business Development Centers, SCORE mentors and Women's Business Centers. Search by ZIP code on the SBA local assistance page. These offices give free or low-cost counselling and training.", ["Your ZIP code", "The SBA local assistance page open"], "localAssistance", "you have found one SBDC, SCORE or Women's Business Center near you and written down how to reach it.", [W("SBDC", "Small Business Development Center: a local office giving free or low-cost counselling and training.")]),
      S("Decide your next step", OWN + "Choose one thing to do this week: call the center to confirm it is open, or call the free help office you just found. Put the day on your calendar. A small next step you actually take is better than a long list you never start.", ["A calendar or a piece of paper"], null, "you have chosen one call to make and written down the day you will make it.", [])
